            tagline = "A mystery in an apartment community leads Mariam to uncover a story about community, evidence and change.",
            parts = listOf(
            StoryPart(1, "The First Oddity", listOf("Mariam first noticed seed packets appear beside rooftop planters. It seemed too small to interest anyone else, but it did not fit the records Mariam had seen. Instead of guessing, Mariam wrote down the date, the conditions, and exactly what had been observed.", "A friend suggested an exciting explanation, but Mariam wrote it under a heading marked \"possibility\", not \"fact\". That small choice shaped the investigation: every idea would need a second source before it became part of the answer.")),
