            StoryPart(3, "The Older Record", listOf("At the archive, the team found a document that changed the direction of the search. Its handwriting was familiar, but the date did not match the story repeated around an apartment community. They photographed the public record and noted the discrepancy.", "Two sources disagreed about what happened. Rather than discard either one, the group checked where each had come from and discovered that they described different stages of the same project.")),
            StoryPart(4, "A Helpful Witness", listOf("A new helper joined the project with knowledge of the place that the students lacked. Together they revisited the evidence and found a connection between a small physical detail and an old decision. The mystery now had a testable explanation.", "The helper pointed out that the mystery affected people differently depending on where they lived or worked. The team widened its questions and made sure quieter voices were included in the final account.")),
            StoryPart(5, "The Detail That Repeats", listOf("The group laid every clue across a large table. The pattern was clear enough to suggest a theory, but one piece still did not fit. Mariam insisted they check the awkward detail rather than hide it to make the story neater.", "They tried to disprove their favourite theory. One observation ruled out an easy answer, and the team had to redraw its timeline. The revised explanation was less dramatic but fitted the evidence much better.")),
            StoryPart(6, "A Fair Test", listOf("They designed a careful test, asked the right people for permission, and wrote down what would count as evidence. The first result surprised them. It supported part of the theory but showed that their original explanation was incomplete.", "The test was repeated with a second set of observations. This time the results were consistent. The students wrote down the limits of the test so nobody would mistake a local finding for a universal rule.")),
            StoryPart(7, "The Meeting", listOf("The team presented its findings to the people who used an apartment community. Some were enthusiastic; others worried about cost, access, and who would maintain the project. Mariam listened and revised the proposal to answer those practical concerns.", "The meeting produced useful suggestions and one important warning: a solution that depended on a single volunteer would not last. The team added shared responsibilities, clear instructions, and a date for reviewing the result.")),
            StoryPart(8, "A Complication", listOf("A setback arrived just before the planned demonstration. A key record could not be found and the weather disrupted the schedule. The team divided the remaining tasks, checked the backup evidence, and agreed not to claim more than they could prove.", "Mariam found the missing detail in an unexpected place: an old label had been filed with the wrong project. Once it was matched to the correct record, the last contradiction disappeared.")),
            StoryPart(9, "The Evidence", listOf("The final comparison confirmed the explanation: neighbours started an informal seed exchange. The discovery was not a tale of a mysterious stranger or a hidden treasure, but a piece of local knowledge that had been separated from its context.", "Those involved corrected the public account and thanked the people whose careful records made the answer possible. They also explained what remained uncertain, keeping the final story honest and useful.")),
